.TH tkutlfooter n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkutlfooter
.PP
A footer row for a \fBtablelist\fR widget, realised as a second single\-row tablelist below the main table ("header at the bottom" look).
.PP
The footer mirrors the main table's column widths, order and alignment, keeps horizontal scrolling in sync, and can compute auto\-sums. Library\-neutral.
.SS Commands
.CS
::tkutils::tkutlfooter::attach  tblMain tblFoot ?\-autowire 1?
::tkutils::tkutlfooter::update  tblMain tblFoot
::tkutils::tkutlfooter::setvals tblFoot {val0 val1 ...}
::tkutils::tkutlfooter::autosum tblMain tblFoot ?\-columns {1 2}? ?\-label "SUM:"? ?\-format "%.2f"?
::tkutils::tkutlfooter::detach  tblMain tblFoot
.CE
.SS attach
.PP
Configures \fItblFoot\fR as a label\-less, non\-selectable single footer row, clones the main table's columns, and wires up the sync bindings. With \fB\-autowire 1\fR (default) horizontal scrolling is coupled: via a \fBscrollutil::scrollsync\fR widget when \fBscrollutil\fR is present, otherwise via a manual \fB\-xscrollcommand\fR bridge.
.SS update
.PP
Re\-applies the main table's column order, widths, alignment and stretch to the footer. Bound automatically to \fB<<TablelistColumnResized>>\fR, \fB<<TablelistColumnMoved>>\fR and \fB<Configure>\fR.
.SS setvals
.PP
Writes explicit values into the footer row, indexed by column.
.SS autosum
.PP
Computes column sums over the main table and writes the formatted totals into the footer; column 0 receives \fB\-label\fR. Only the columns in \fB\-columns\fR are summed (default: all). Number parsing uses \fBtclutils::tunum\fR when available, otherwise a built\-in parser. Display\-only \(em re\-run after data changes.
.SS detach
.PP
Removes the sync bindings and restores the original scroll wiring.
.SS "Error codes"
.PP
Errors are raised with \fB\-errorcode {TKUTILS TKUTLFOOTER <REASON>}\fR.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tkutils::tkutablelist(n), tclutils::tunum(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
tablelist, footer, sum, scroll sync
